        "title": "Disappointing",
        "text": "The temple is beautiful but it is absolutely dirty. There are way too many animals, and garbage piles everywhere. They didn't clean the goat/dog/cow crap inside the temple campus. Extremely disappointed. Its a shame UNESCO has not taken over the temple knowing that Nepal needs money to upkeep the temple. As I walked through the temple buildings (its a huge complex with lots of temple buildings) I could conjure up an image of what it would have looked like years ago (better than any Chinese hollywood movie that showed long corridors and elegant walkways)",
