        "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r364782156-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html",
        "title": "Skip the entrance - sneak in",
        "text": "Very interesting temple to observe the crematoria and funeral ceremonies. \n\nEntrance fee is 1000 NPR, that's nonsense so we sneaked in. Follow the crown towards the Hindu temple, stop before the entrance because non-Hindus cannot enter. Hike up the hill to your left, about 100 meters in you will see a fence. Follow the fence to the right, the fence ends in 50m where you will see the river. Cross the fence (no climbing needed) and follow the path down to the river, that will lead you to the crematoria which is exactly where you need to be. \n\nGood luck.",
